                          <SHORT-NAME>FrTSynGlobalTimeSequenceCounterHysteresis</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">FrTSynGlobalTimeSequenceCounterHysteresis specifies the number of consecutive valid SYNC messages that are required by the Time Slave while being in Timeout state until a Time Tuple is forwarded to the StbM.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
